# SDP Dashboard — PLACEHOLDER manifest verification key (Ed25519, SPKI PEM).
# Replace this file with the REAL public key before the first signed release: the private half
# of this placeholder was generated once and discarded, so NO package can carry a signature that
# this key accepts. Until the real key is committed, every package is "unsigned" and the Manager
# refuses it unless --allow-unsigned is passed (logged). The matching private key lives ONLY in
# the CI secret SIGNING_MANIFEST_KEY (PKCS8 PEM) — never in this repository.
-----BEGIN PUBLIC KEY-----
MCowBQYDK2VwAyEADUW00jkJBlC5OHwm7d38Uut9Xl+PtXJTfI4ZDKDwzMg=
-----END PUBLIC KEY-----
